  "local_adaptations": [
    "Preserve controlled scheduling attempt context while passing inflight reservation to accounting.",
    "Preserve native Anthropic failover/response-model handling around streaming usage changes.",
    "Deleted users, subscriptions/groups and accounts retain existing usage liabilities; batch holds can settle/refund to a deleted owner.",
    "Durable credential-free billing intents; transactional usage logs; restart recovery; cache invalidation checkpoint; no automatic historical backcharge.",
    "Financial handler tasks execute inline before handler completion; no drop/sample or volatile queue acceptance.",
    "Platform quotas commit in the money transaction; legacy absolute Redis snapshot flusher must be drained and disabled.",
    "API key creation adds a per-user database lock and counts recent tombstones, supplementing upstream Redis limits.",
    "Reject duplicate EasyPay callback parameters.",
    "Every positive inflight reservation, including the first, must fit its estimated available balance; cache failure defaults to fail closed.",
    "Unpriced paid admission defaults to fail closed; explicitly zero-priced/free groups still pass.",
    "Persist scheduling attempt IDs and acknowledge the scheduler after recovery; immediately complete cache checkpoints on normal requests, including deduplicated retries."
  ],
